@startuml sd_us201
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US201 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftModelController" as AircraftModelController
participant "UpdateAircraftModelUseCase" as UpdateAircraftModelUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== PATCH /api/aircraftModels/{modelName} ==
Actor -> EAM : PATCH /api/aircraftModels/{modelName}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> UpdateAircraftModelUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateAircraftModelUseCase -> DBAM : apply the change to this replica's copy\n+ one copy per other replica in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateAircraftModelUseCase --> AircraftModelController : updated
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircraft-models\n(to every other replica; the latest change wins)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
